{
  "name": "Telegram AI Agent - OpenAI + Simple Memory (Docker Local)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Wajib sebelum aktivasi\n1. Pilih credential **Telegram Bot API** yang sama pada `Telegram Trigger` dan `Send Telegram Reply`.\n2. Pilih credential **OpenAI API** pada `OpenAI Chat Model`.\n3. Pastikan `WEBHOOK_URL` n8n adalah URL publik HTTPS milik n8n, bukan `https://api.telegram.org`.\n4. Simpan lalu **Publish/Activate** workflow agar n8n mendaftarkan webhook Telegram.\n\nCek status webhook:\n`https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getWebhookInfo`",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "fb605663-987f-4c7e-ba04-51e62ab77809",
      "name": "Setup Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "e0976943-ae3d-4e1d-9abe-a9e6f5f25996",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "webhookId": "983c3558-1e7d-42be-8997-aa37da82b58a",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "C6X7rYkhhuTCPdSW",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const update = $input.first().json;\nconst m = update.message ?? update.edited_message;\nif (!m || m.chat?.type !== 'private' || typeof m.text !== 'string' || !m.text.trim() || m.from?.is_bot === true) return [];\nconst chatId = String(m.chat.id);\nreturn [{ json: { chatId, sessionId: 'telegram:' + chatId, chatInput: m.text.trim().slice(0, 4000) } }];"
      },
      "id": "098fbff1-cc5a-4656-9711-d84aaa9f975a",
      "name": "Normalize Telegram Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        224,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Kamu adalah asisten AI Telegram yang ramah, ringkas, membantu, dan akurat. Jawab dalam bahasa Indonesia yang natural. Jangan mengarang fakta atau mengklaim punya akses ke sistem atau informasi real-time yang tidak tersedia. Jika pertanyaan ambigu, minta klarifikasi singkat. Gunakan teks sederhana yang nyaman dibaca di Telegram."
        }
      },
      "id": "ac7742d9-d32d-4184-9990-4e5e8de31031",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        448,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Normalize Telegram Message').first().json.sessionId }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "d66624c4-c958-45f3-be83-97d5788e2ded",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
